        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-17T20:37:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My thought was somewhere in between this and the current CL -- you still call `add` but within that use the isUploadTask virtual to check to see if the new Task is an upload, and set the bool at that point.",
      "parentUuid": "3956f32d_b6631cee",
      "revId": "7382cae4b0f6a009125a87c89d1e0e2a23552f09",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
